  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAtr">IV Atr</ref> 6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Et praecipimus ne quis pecuniam puram et recte appendentem sonet, monetetur in quocumque portu monetetur in regno meo, super overhirnessam meam.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And we enjoin that no-one shall refuse pure money of the proper weight, in whatever town in my kingdom it be coined, under pain of incurring the fine for insubordination to me.</ab>
      </div>
